# UGC AI Production Engine Rules

- Always execute Mandatory Checkpoint 1 (Escenario/Location, Outfit, ManyChat Keyword, Cover Headline) before Phase 3.
- Always adhere to the JSON-First architecture validated by `tools/schemas/production_package.py`.
- Enforce speech cadence limit of <= 2.4 words per second per chunk.
- Never use banned words ('age', 'DM') in video scripts or audio prompts.
- Ensure all video dialogues are brand-decoupled (generic/educational); conversion is handled via ManyChat.
- Keep `01_Reference/` clean (max 8 files: 1 video, keyframes 01-06, 1 script txt).
- All final deliverables must contain strictly 4 files (.mp4, .srt, .jpg, .txt).
- Always verify projects with `python tools/ugc_harness.py --project [PROJECT]`.
